<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - Brutal Game Studios</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f1115;
            --card-bg: #181b22;
            --text-color: #c9d1d9;
            --heading-color: #ffffff;
            --accent-color: #e63946;
            --border-color: #30363d;
            --link-color: #58a6ff;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--heading-color);
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .meta {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--heading-color);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            margin-top: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p, ul {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 24px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        a {
            color: var(--link-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .contact-box {
            background-color: #1f242c;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="meta">
        <strong>Developer / Studio:</strong> Brutal Game Studios<br>
        <strong>Effective Date:</strong> October 8, 2026<br>
        <strong>Validity Period:</strong> October 8, 2026 – October 8, 2051
    </div>

    <p>
        This Privacy Policy applies to the mobile games and applications created, published, and maintained by 
        <strong>Brutal Game Studios</strong> ("we", "our", or "us") on the Google Play Store. We are dedicated 
        to protecting the privacy of our players and users.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Depending on the features enabled within our games, we may collect or process the following categories of information:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Device and Technical Information:</strong> IP address, device model, operating system version, unique device identifiers (e.g., Android Advertising ID), and mobile network details.</li>
        <li><strong>Gameplay and Performance Data:</strong> In-game progress, scores, crash logs, frame rate statistics, and session duration to identify performance issues and improve user experience.</li>
        <li><strong>User-Provided Information:</strong> If you reach out to customer support, we may collect your email address, username, and any message details you provide.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
        Our applications may integrate third-party software development kits (SDKs) to provide core functionality, 
        analytics, and advertising services compliant with Google Play Policies. These partners may collect and process 
        anonymized or pseudo-anonymized data under their respective privacy policies:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google AdMob</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Firebase / Crashlytics</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://unity.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unity Analytics</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>We use the data collected strictly for legitimate game operations and development:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>To operate, test, debug, and improve game stability and performance.</li>
        <li>To deliver relevant updates, bug fixes, and feature releases.</li>
        <li>To serve advertisements and reward players for opt-in ad engagements (if applicable).</li>
        <li>To ensure compliance with Google Play Developer Program Policies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Children’s Privacy</h2>
    <p>
        Our games are designed in accordance with Google Play's Families Policy requirements. We do not knowingly 
        collect personal identifiable information from children under the age of 13 (or the relevant age threshold 
        in your jurisdiction). If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has provided us with 
        personal data, please contact us immediately so we can promptly delete such information.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
    <p>
        We retain operational log data and analytics only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes set out in 
        this policy or as required by law. Users can request the deletion of any associated data or contact information 
        by reaching out to our support team at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Security</h2>
    <p>
        We employ standard administrative and technical safeguards designed to protect personal information from 
        unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Policy Changes</h2>
    <p>
        This policy remains valid and effective from <strong>October 8, 2026</strong> through <strong>October 8, 2051</strong>, 
        subject to periodic updates to reflect evolving technical, legal, or Google Play store policy requirements. 
        Any changes will be posted directly to this page.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-box">
        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your data, please contact:</p>
        <p>
            <strong>Brutal Game Studios</strong><br>
            Email: <a href="mailto:BrutalMotorWorks@gmail.com">BrutalMotorWorks@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
